{"concept":"overman","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":46}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-25202066f8da83c9b39df192727745af","tos.text-unit.sid-25202066f8da83c9b39df192727745af"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учение о сверхчеловеке спрашивает, что сделано для преодоления человека.","en":"The overman’s teaching asks what has been done to overcome the human."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-24602bf436ec7d5105de5080d0f9f378","tos.text-unit.sid-24602bf436ec7d5105de5080d0f9f378"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек задаёт человеку меру смеха и стыда.","en":"The overman gives the human a measure of laughter and shame."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb9bcf50d72378d95e4759d304747179","tos.text-unit.sid-ed69e3c67d9d7ed5f4c8bcaa584c0356"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля придаёт земле смысл через сверхчеловека.","en":"Willing gives earth meaning through the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3abdeaa39d3d0ed131d72653baec0dbe","tos.text-unit.sid-3abdeaa39d3d0ed131d72653baec0dbe"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["going-under","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек изображён морем для великого презрения.","en":"The overman is pictured as a sea for great contempt."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-27fd668def8925859fac4467d2119f95","tos.text-unit.sid-27fd668def8925859fac4467d2119f95"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек возвещён молнией и безумием.","en":"The overman is proclaimed as lightning and madness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-992a7291ae2c1aafcd976cb8ffc2ff7e","tos.text-unit.sid-992a7291ae2c1aafcd976cb8ffc2ff7e"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["rope-bridge","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Человек изображён канатом между животным и сверхчеловеком.","en":"The human is pictured as a rope between animal and overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9779ce86c7ab16f862fc2b94d6b70c2d","tos.text-unit.sid-9779ce86c7ab16f862fc2b94d6b70c2d"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Земной дар себя готовит землю сверхчеловеку.","en":"An earthly giving of oneself prepares the earth for the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-253e021493f9aa17d90ef76bdc0b54c6","tos.text-unit.sid-253e021493f9aa17d90ef76bdc0b54c6"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","going-under","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Познание направляет жизнь к будущему сверхчеловеку.","en":"Knowing directs life toward the future overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7733c52a51283f67dd29b62903f33ba9","tos.text-unit.sid-7733c52a51283f67dd29b62903f33ba9"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","going-under","earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Труд и изобретение готовят будущему землю и жилище.","en":"Work and invention prepare earth and a dwelling for the future."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3134004470ef78536cd4f683350185e5","tos.text-unit.sid-3134004470ef78536cd4f683350185e5"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель возвещает сверхчеловека молнией из тучи.","en":"The teacher proclaims the overman as lightning from a cloud."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1854da398df3ee2655605c8612f6d608","tos.text-unit.sid-1854da398df3ee2655605c8612f6d608"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["bestowing-virtue","becoming","last-man","joy-lust","zarathustra","people"],"line":{"ru":"Народ предлагает сверхчеловека в обмен на последнего человека.","en":"The people offer the overman in exchange for the last man."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c1afc203dac6e6b85d24f695b47185b3","tos.text-unit.sid-c1afc203dac6e6b85d24f695b47185b3"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек даёт существованию смысл молнии из человеческой тучи.","en":"The overman gives existence the meaning of lightning from the human cloud."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7052c6e4468b36395fbc56054dfd5c1c","tos.text-unit.sid-7052c6e4468b36395fbc56054dfd5c1c"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель выбирает созидателей спутниками ступеней сверхчеловека.","en":"The teacher chooses creators as companions on the overman’s steps."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-adbd869e1d47add4f63b6dca9759f76f","tos.text-unit.sid-adbd869e1d47add4f63b6dca9759f76f"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["body-self","rope-bridge","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра отказывает презрению тела в пути к сверхчеловеку.","en":"Zarathustra denies contempt for the body a path to the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b47701b2c98827c69e79d18c6ecaf9a8","tos.text-unit.sid-b47701b2c98827c69e79d18c6ecaf9a8"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к сверхчеловеку должна оправдать дальнейшую жизнь судей.","en":"Love of the overman is to justify the judges’ continuing life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-db12764419e7764907c1153b493ab19d","tos.text-unit.sid-db12764419e7764907c1153b493ab19d"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["rope-bridge","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Конец государства открывает образ мостов сверхчеловека.","en":"The state’s end opens the image of the overman’s bridges."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e7a07458c991f7918a1f0b914f65697b","tos.text-unit.sid-e7a07458c991f7918a1f0b914f65697b"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Другу поручено стать стрелой тоски по сверхчеловеку.","en":"The friend is charged with becoming an arrow of longing for the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e41bf3760f46cb05f216c97154f97665","tos.text-unit.sid-e41bf3760f46cb05f216c97154f97665"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Друг назван праздником земли и предчувствием сверхчеловека.","en":"The friend is named earth’s festival and a foretaste of the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-22ec1714a02b773fb8cdaf3e052261e2","tos.text-unit.sid-22ec1714a02b773fb8cdaf3e052261e2"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к будущему становится причиной сегодняшнего дела.","en":"Love of the future becomes the cause of today’s deed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-54016d472053d8bed6ed7fb50adb1dc2","tos.text-unit.sid-54016d472053d8bed6ed7fb50adb1dc2"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"old-woman","mode":"quoted","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь получает надежду рождения сверхчеловека.","en":"Love receives the hope of giving birth to the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6e78e324597d3ea67384aed90d0e514f","tos.text-unit.sid-6e78e324597d3ea67384aed90d0e514f"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Горечь любви превращается в жажду творца и тоску по сверхчеловеку.","en":"Love’s bitterness becomes the creator’s thirst and longing for the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b2a2feff62a2c60e09457433461189cf","tos.text-unit.sid-b2a2feff62a2c60e09457433461189cf"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Брак спрашивается через волю к творцу и будущему сверхчеловеку.","en":"Marriage is questioned through willing the creator and future overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-028641b540d5df0b304fac2c13c54af2","tos.text-unit.sid-028641b540d5df0b304fac2c13c54af2"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Одиночки будущего народа готовят появление сверхчеловека.","en":"The future people’s solitary ones prepare the overman’s coming."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-141fcbf511cfb1dfc36bb084891e48b0","tos.text-unit.sid-141fcbf511cfb1dfc36bb084891e48b0"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["great-noon","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Великий полдень празднует середину пути к сверхчеловеку.","en":"Great noon celebrates the midpoint of the path to the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4526c85af8b25eef16ed2c2dac290d69","tos.text-unit.sid-4526c85af8b25eef16ed2c2dac290d69"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["great-noon","will","death-of-god","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Последняя воля полдня желает жизни сверхчеловека.","en":"Noon’s final will desires the overman’s life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ca1f9b16367f7de829f39026e0b5e0ab","tos.text-unit.sid-ca1f9b16367f7de829f39026e0b5e0ab"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Имя сверхчеловека занимает место прежнего дальнего имени Бога.","en":"The overman’s name takes the place of the former distant name of God."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6cb7915a7b167f31ab6190f48c47b800","tos.text-unit.sid-6cb7915a7b167f31ab6190f48c47b800"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вопрос о создании Бога переводится в задачу создания сверхчеловека.","en":"The question of creating God becomes the task of creating the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff00df1df88a0e09f942944d9214a5d1","tos.text-unit.sid-ff00df1df88a0e09f942944d9214a5d1"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Слушатели могут преобразить себя в предков сверхчеловека.","en":"The listeners can transform themselves into the overman’s ancestors."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7a6eb2649742c982b67d6c1496e91837","tos.text-unit.sid-7a6eb2649742c982b67d6c1496e91837"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Красота сверхчеловека приходит тенью будущего.","en":"The overman’s beauty comes as the shadow of the future."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-eac21ac75bfe5cc7c15447e3f07645c4","tos.text-unit.sid-eac21ac75bfe5cc7c15447e3f07645c4"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра говорит о сверхчеловеке как о ещё предстоящем.","en":"Zarathustra speaks of the overman as still to come."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6dd0863558b94bcd66df0933e49dcf1f","tos.text-unit.sid-6dd0863558b94bcd66df0933e49dcf1f"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к сверхчеловеку требует восходящих различий.","en":"Love of the overman calls for ascending differences."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ac1fc8eea84199cd991f3d3a10796a3a","tos.text-unit.sid-ac1fc8eea84199cd991f3d3a10796a3a"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Речь о поэтах испытывает само слово «сверхчеловек» образом облачных выдумок.","en":"The speech about poets tests the word “overman” through cloud-borne inventions."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b7deeddaec4cbe4b294df1083cfe7cf4","tos.text-unit.sid-b7deeddaec4cbe4b294df1083cfe7cf4"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лёгкость выдуманных богов становится предметом иронии.","en":"The lightness of invented gods becomes a subject of irony."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-62bffc7677d3e8bdd345a3ae2c984d7c","tos.text-unit.sid-62bffc7677d3e8bdd345a3ae2c984d7c"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Две воли связывают Заратустру с человеком и сверхчеловеком.","en":"Two wills bind Zarathustra to human and overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f554055a28e1f1d5a0ae426811357bff","tos.text-unit.sid-f554055a28e1f1d5a0ae426811357bff"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Будущему сверхчеловеку готовится достойный дракон.","en":"A worthy dragon is prepared for the future overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3b144dc38429be2ef65694695dd42f0b","tos.text-unit.sid-3b144dc38429be2ef65694695dd42f0b"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Доброта сверхчеловека способна ужаснуть нынешних слушателей.","en":"The overman’s goodness can terrify present listeners."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aad1488f0e3f14091074b18e16e5d069","tos.text-unit.sid-aad1488f0e3f14091074b18e16e5d069"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мудрость сверхчеловека изображена обнажённостью на солнцепёке.","en":"The overman’s wisdom is pictured as nakedness in scorching sun."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ae9d21e75145dcd61784920c2355ce67","tos.text-unit.sid-ae9d21e75145dcd61784920c2355ce67"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Высшие люди могли бы назвать сверхчеловека дьяволом.","en":"The higher men might call the overman a devil."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5569b1b15981db0d781b1a0a1bc655a5","tos.text-unit.sid-5569b1b15981db0d781b1a0a1bc655a5"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учителя влечёт дальше высоты лучших нынешних людей.","en":"The teacher is drawn beyond the height of today’s best people."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d207728565661c0f96eff9a7dd974be5","tos.text-unit.sid-d207728565661c0f96eff9a7dd974be5"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек вновь назван словом о человеческом преодолении.","en":"The overman is again named as the word of human overcoming."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a998deaa0d79cfc5097656687fe684e5","tos.text-unit.sid-a998deaa0d79cfc5097656687fe684e5"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Совет брачной честности связан с любовью к будущему сверхчеловеку.","en":"Advice on marital honesty is joined to love of the future overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ce045055585467cfc09217fef32bfa81","tos.text-unit.sid-03419225d5cdf6f8a5e19876524d7a31"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["recurrence","great-noon","identity","earth","animals","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Звери включают новое возвещение сверхчеловека в возвращение той же жизни.","en":"The animals include proclaiming the overman again in the recurrence of the same life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f585907d3c7a54afb3c54d7ec02c99f6","tos.text-unit.sid-f585907d3c7a54afb3c54d7ec02c99f6"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","circle","death-of-god","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Человеческое будущее рождает волю к жизни сверхчеловека.","en":"The human future gives birth to willing the overman’s life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f34a733226cce217f47c30c5278d1bc8","tos.text-unit.sid-f34a733226cce217f47c30c5278d1bc8"]},"form":"Übermensch","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сверхчеловек назван первым и единственным делом сердца.","en":"The overman is named the heart’s first and sole concern."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-91a9d4f6808755d30d199cd30465d2b5","tos.text-unit.sid-91a9d4f6808755d30d199cd30465d2b5"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мелкие господа настоящего объявлены опасностью для сверхчеловека.","en":"The present’s petty masters are declared a danger to the overman."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-39bbc79dc14e690bed688203031625fe","tos.text-unit.sid-39bbc79dc14e690bed688203031625fe"]},"form":"Übermenschen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","necessity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лучшее сверхчеловека связывается с самым злым человеческим.","en":"The overman’s best is joined to the human’s worst."}}]}
